{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":30.25,"text":"Six marble young women held up the roof of a small temple on the rock, the Erechtheion, instead of columns. Five stand here in a row, with the dap of the sixth beside them. She is in the British Museum in London. Look at their feet. Each one bends a different knee, so that none of them look strained. Their plaits fall thick down the back of the neck, and that is not decoration. They strengthen the thin neck, which would otherwise be the first thing to snap. www.globalonenessproject.org","words":[{"word":"Six","start":0,"end":0.7200000286102295},{"word":"marble","start":0.7200000286102295,"end":1.2599999904632568},{"word":"young","start":1.2599999904632568,"end":1.7200000286102295},{"word":"women","start":1.7200000286102295,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"held","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"up","start":2.4200000762939453,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"the","start":2.640000104904175,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"roof","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"of","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.259999990463257},{"word":"a","start":3.259999990463257,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"small","start":3.440000057220459,"end":3.740000009536743},{"word":"temple","start":3.740000009536743,"end":4.039999961853027},{"word":"on","start":4.039999961853027,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"the","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"rock","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.739999771118164},{"word":"the","start":5.260000228881836,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"Erechtheion","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"instead","start":6.480000019073486,"end":6.599999904632568},{"word":"of","start":6.599999904632568,"end":6.900000095367432},{"word":"columns","start":6.900000095367432,"end":7.320000171661377},{"word":"Five","start":8.279999732971191,"end":8.420000076293945},{"word":"stand","start":8.420000076293945,"end"